      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua-follow1:088",
        "answer": "Builds game-status decorative panels, kills/players-left children, teammate/spectator counts and left/right endgame status lists. Nonnil aliveTeammateCount/spectatorsCount are sent directly to text. Each status display filters right-solo gameInformation versus left-solo hudGameStat, then assigns its exact endgame datasource names. Registers close, optional postload, returns self. This displays supplied data without computing ranks, population or results.",
